{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他刚沉进满足里，熟悉的生活感忽然闯来，身体先绷紧，回神后又懊恼自己忘了还有事要面对。\",\n      \"key\": \"身体先绷紧\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"珍惜的东西仍受威胁，他又想起当初不肯再等，光怀念护不住那种生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"不肯再等\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想重新投入，却怕自己又把累当软弱，硬撑到最后磨掉想珍惜的温柔。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他原以为想明白为什么要行动就能安心，如今还得顾着别把温柔磨掉，反而更难定心。\",\n      \"key\": \"更难定心\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R32\", \"R35\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\", \"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留安宁之后突然回神、身体先于念头受惊，以及懊恼自己忘了还有事要面对的认识。熟悉的生活感解释突兀转向，现实仍未改变则由下一条接住，不把珠子里的场景写成真实往事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R33\", \"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把不能只靠怀念写成珍惜的东西仍受威胁、光怀念护不住向往的生活；保留当初不肯再等的行动理由，并用箭头回指S02-1，不重复展开旧因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R36\", \"R37\", \"R38\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\", \"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"留下的风险由S07-2说明，重新投入的代价由S07-3说明。保留他已不能像从前那样毫无顾忌地行动，以及怕重演硬撑、磨掉温柔的恐惧；删除R38对两难的对称复述。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R39\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他原以为想明白理由就能安心、如今反而更难定心的认识。新增的顾虑明确落在行动可能磨掉温柔上，并用箭头接回S01-3最初寻找足够理由的想法。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"这是对音乐材料的另一种辨认，不必与主体验同时成立。无需据此补写他重新站直或找回旧日自我的心理过程。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "532a0ad9-0629-49d1-9e4f-536c3a45ba1a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T114845248787Z", "elapsed_seconds": 797.625, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T12:02:02.888082+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "366caf79e3508131c7bd9ce519b300a0ac781cbb59596cb0b79ef998500c6561", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T114845248787Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4d42495e47bf0aa5eaf5a77f60ae1d8e9ceded7e9cc0b2f50f1592f17513b1d9"}}}
